 "tone": "var(--k-advance)",
 "leadHtml": "<p class=\"eyebrow bp-eyebrow\"><span class=\"index\">SOUND</span> V0.27.0 <span class=\"brick-sticker\" data-flag=\"complete\" style=\"--tilt:3.5deg;--dx:5px;--dy:-1px\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></p>\n        <h1 id=\"bp-title\" class=\"bp-title\"><code>@fzlt/core/sound</code></h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">The sound adapter. After each frame it reads the engine's event ring and plays the mapped cues, so collisions and game events make sound without knowing about audio. The default voice is a tiny synth (oscillators, no assets); pass <code>play</code> to use your own sounds. Silent until the first trusted gesture, while paused, and when switched off.</p>\n        <div class=\"split-keys\"><a class=\"bui-key bui-arcade bui-sys\" href=\"#api\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 5 2 10l5 5M13 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg>API</a><a class=\"bui-key bui-arcade bui-cmd\" href=\"https://github.com/coded-dot-design/fizlet/blob/main/src/sound.ts\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7.5 17c-4 1.2-4-2-5.5-2.5m11 4.5v-3a2.6 2.6 0 0 0-.7-2c2.4-.3 4.9-1.2 4.9-5.3a4.1 4.1 0 0 0-1.1-2.8 3.8 3.8 0 0 0-.1-2.8s-.9-.3-2.9 1.1a10 10 0 0 0-5.2 0C5.9 2.8 5 3.1 5 3.1a3.8 3.8 0 0 0-.1 2.8 4.1 4.1 0 0 0-1.1 2.8c0 4.1 2.5 5 4.9 5.3a2.6 2.6 0 0 0-.7 2v3\"></path></svg>Source ↗</a></div>",
 "asideHtml": "<div class=\"bp-sizes\"><div class=\"panel bp-size\"><span class=\"bui-label\"><b>@fzlt/core/sound</b> · GZIP</span><b class=\"bp-bytes\" data-size=\"@fzlt/core/sound\">1,062 B</b><small>1.0 KB of a 1.5 KB budget</small><span class=\"meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"--v:0.691\"></i></span></div><p class=\"bp-note\">Measured on this build: minified and gzipped with everything it imports, the way <code>npm run size</code> checks the budget in CI.</p></div>",
