   "html": "<div class=\"panel bp-status\" data-flag=\"complete\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"bui-label\"><b>STATUS</b> · <a href=\"/bricks/#status\">what the flags mean</a></span><span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></div>\n      <p>Done, and always getting smaller and faster.</p>\n      \n      <dl>\n        <div><dt>SINCE</dt><dd>v0.2.0</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>SHIPPED IN</dt><dd><ul><li>Battlefield Blitz 1.0.1</li><li>Null Invaders 1.0.3, Byte Runner 1.0.2 and Sherman Bytes 1.1.0 (through @fzlt/core/arcade)</li></ul></dd></div>\n        <div><dt>TESTS</dt><dd><ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/coded-dot-design/fizlet/blob/main/tests/sound.test.mjs\"><code>sound.test.mjs</code> ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/coded-dot-design/fizlet/blob/main/tests/browser.mjs\"><code>browser.mjs</code> ↗</a></li></ul></dd></div>\n      </dl>\n    </div>"
