   "kind": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"panel code-card bp-snippet\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span class=\"bui-label\"><b>IN SHORT</b></span></div><pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>const sfx = sound(e, { cues: { boom: &quot;boom&quot; } });\ne.events.emit(&quot;boom&quot;); // in a step; plays after render\nsfx.on = false;        // mute</code></pre></div>"
