  {
   "kind": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"bp-api\" id=\"api\">\n      <h2>API</h2>\n      <p class=\"bp-note\">Every export with its signature, parameters, return type, doc comment and status flag, generated at build time from the published type declarations of v0.27.0 by the TypeScript compiler. For AI agents: <a href=\"/llms-full.txt\">the whole API as plain text</a>.</p>\n      <nav class=\"panel bp-toc\" aria-label=\"Exports\"><ul><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-Cue\"><code>Cue</code></a><small>type</small></li><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-CueName\"><code>CueName</code></a><small>type</small></li><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-Note\"><code>Note</code></a><small>type</small></li><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-SoundOptions\"><code>SoundOptions</code></a><small>interface</small></li><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-sound\"><code>sound</code></a><small>function</small></li><li><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-Sound\"><code>Sound</code></a><small>type</small></li></ul></nav>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-Cue\">\n        <h3><code>Cue</code> <small>type</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>A built-in sound cue the synth can play.</p>\n        \n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export type Cue = &quot;fire&quot; | &quot;hit&quot; | &quot;boom&quot; | &quot;hurt&quot; | &quot;power&quot; | &quot;ready&quot; | &quot;win&quot; | &quot;end&quot; | &quot;click&quot;;</code></pre>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-CueName\">\n        <h3><code>CueName</code> <small>type</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>A cue name: a built-in Cue, or one of your own <code>notes</code>.</p>\n        \n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export type CueName = Cue | (string &amp; {});</code></pre>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-Note\">\n        <h3><code>Note</code> <small>type</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>One synth voice: pitch from → to (Hz) over <code>sec</code>, after <code>delay</code>, its wave and volume.</p>\n        \n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export type Note = [from: number, to: number, sec: number, delay: number, wave: OscillatorType, vol: number];</code></pre>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-SoundOptions\">\n        <h3><code>SoundOptions</code> <small>interface</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>Options for <code>sound()</code>: which event types play which cue, on or off, volume, or your own player.</p>\n        \n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export interface SoundOptions {\n    /** event type → cue, e.g. { shot: &quot;fire&quot;, wreck: &quot;boom&quot; }. */\n    cues: Record&lt;string, CueName&gt;;\n    /** Your own cues for the built-in synth: name → voices (a name here wins over a built-in). */\n    notes?: Record&lt;string, Note[]&gt;;\n    /** Start switched on (default true). */\n    on?: boolean;\n    /** Master volume 0..1 (default 0.12). */\n    volume?: number;\n    /** Your own player instead of the synth. */\n    play?: (cue: CueName, intensity: number) =&gt; void;\n}</code></pre>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-sound\">\n        <h3><code>sound</code> <small>function</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>The sound adapter for engine <code>e</code>: after each frame it plays the cue mapped to each event in the ring. Silent until the first trusted gesture and while paused; set <code>on</code> to mute, <code>dispose()</code> to remove it.</p>\n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code bp-sig\"><code>sound(e: Engine, o: SoundOptions): Sound</code></pre>\n        <dl class=\"bp-params\"><div><dt><code>e</code></dt><dd><code>Engine</code></dd></div><div><dt><code>o</code></dt><dd><code><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-SoundOptions\">SoundOptions</a></code></dd></div><div><dt>Returns</dt><dd><code><a href=\"#api-fzlt-core-sound-Sound\">Sound</a></code></dd></div></dl>\n        <details class=\"bp-full\"><summary>Declaration</summary><pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export declare function sound(e: Engine, o: SoundOptions): {\n    play: (cue: CueName, intensity?: number, at?: number) =&gt; void;\n    dispose: () =&gt; void;\n    on: boolean;\n    /** The audio clock in seconds (it stands still while suspended or muted), -1 before the first gesture. */\n    readonly time: number;\n};</code></pre></details>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bp-decl\" id=\"api-fzlt-core-sound-Sound\">\n        <h3><code>Sound</code> <small>type</small> <span class=\"status-pill\" data-flag=\"complete\" title=\"Done, and always getting smaller and faster.\">COMPLETE</span></h3>\n        <p>The sound adapter <code>sound()</code> returns.</p>\n        \n        <pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"code\"><code>export type Sound = ReturnType&lt;typeof sound&gt;;</code></pre>\n      </article>\n    </div>"
  },
